# iOS Build & Simulator

Use Makefile targets for standard commands: `make build`, `make test`, `make test-unit`, and `make run`.

The `Makefile` defines the correct simulator device, scheme, and destination. Prefer Make targets over raw `xcodebuild` unless a narrower one-off test selection is needed (for example, a specific `-only-testing` case).
